WEBVTT

00:00:02.005 --> 00:00:05.805
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.209 --> 00:00:10.077
Delivers this message

00:00:10.513 --> 00:00:19.080
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.223 --> 00:00:20.690
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:28.798
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.798 --> 00:00:29.093
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.332 --> 00:00:36.602
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.839 --> 00:00:40.969
But please don't look back

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:45.137
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.348 --> 00:00:49.444
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.719 --> 00:00:53.155
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.423 --> 00:00:57.325
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.727 --> 00:01:01.390
Delivers this message

00:01:01.831 --> 00:01:10.000
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.373 --> 00:01:18.576
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.015 --> 00:01:28.686
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:33.396 --> 00:01:36.695
Shurei Hong, who has been assigned to
the post of co-governor of Sa Province...

00:01:36.766 --> 00:01:39.326
...is currently en route to
the place of her assignment.

00:01:40.236 --> 00:01:44.900
Right now, she is faced
with a serious problem...

00:01:45.274 --> 00:01:47.834
...that could have a profound
effect on her future.

00:01:50.913 --> 00:01:54.076
I'm marrying a son of the Sa Clan?!

00:01:55.118 --> 00:02:00.078
An Accidental Resemblance

00:02:00.757 --> 00:02:03.783
What's the matter? The sound
tells me your mind's elsewhere.

00:02:05.061 --> 00:02:07.029
Y-You can tell?

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:09.723
I feel like having some fruit.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:11.999
Okay, I'll bring some.

00:02:19.475 --> 00:02:22.239
Are you worried about the governor's
marriage into the Sa Clan?

00:02:23.713 --> 00:02:28.150
I hear that she's around my age,
and it's a political marriage, right?

00:02:28.818 --> 00:02:30.547
It happens quite often.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:34.886
Yes, but this one seems
rather forceful.

00:02:35.391 --> 00:02:36.358
Not only have they not asked her...

00:02:36.426 --> 00:02:38.894
...they haven't even sought her
family's consent.

00:02:39.996 --> 00:02:42.464
That's because she's the most
cherished Lady of the Hong Clan, right?

00:02:43.065 --> 00:02:44.400
If approached directly...

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:46.368
...the Hong Clan would choose
not to deal with the Sa Clan.

00:02:46.936 --> 00:02:49.302
Sh-She's a cherished lady?

00:02:50.339 --> 00:02:52.830
Members of the Royal family or the
Ran Clan are about the only ones...

00:02:52.909 --> 00:02:53.876
...who would make a suitable match.

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:54.874
Oh?

00:02:55.545 --> 00:02:59.072
Given their extreme pride, the Hong
Clan is not likely to permit it, right?

00:02:59.816 --> 00:03:01.250
Getting their acceptance
after the fact...

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:02.649
...is the only way the
Sa Clan has any chance.

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.584
The Hong family name
really has value.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:10.259
Even the Hong Clan isn't
likely to demand her back...

00:03:10.259 --> 00:03:12.022
...after she's done "that" with someone.

00:03:12.295 --> 00:03:13.091
That?!

00:03:13.162 --> 00:03:17.599
According to rumors, that noblewoman
is very beautiful... and ladylike.

00:03:18.267 --> 00:03:20.394
She's said to be very much
a highborn lady...

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:23.496
...so if something like that were
to happen, they would surely give in.

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:26.465
Even if she were to return, it's unlikely
anyone would take her in marriage.

00:03:27.143 --> 00:03:31.204
W-Wow... a highborn lady...
True, in a way.

00:03:31.781 --> 00:03:37.048
Korin, who is pretending to be me,
is much more ladylike than I am.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:42.723
But I prefer you much more
than some highborn lady.

00:03:46.596 --> 00:03:48.564
Thank you very much.

00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:51.531
Hey, Korin.

00:03:51.601 --> 00:03:52.625
Yes?

00:03:53.202 --> 00:03:55.261
Why are you defending
yourself so strongly?

00:03:56.739 --> 00:03:59.401
You appear to be very timid
when it comes to falling in love.

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.978
When I try to get a little closer to you...

00:04:03.246 --> 00:04:06.682
...you pretend you don't notice and
hide your heart behind strong armor.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:10.251
That's why you keep
calling me Master, right?

00:04:11.053 --> 00:04:13.453
Were you rejected by
some cruel man, perhaps?

00:04:13.789 --> 00:04:16.314
No! It's just...!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:20.557
Please don't forget.
I love you.

00:04:22.665 --> 00:04:24.860
I'm not at all prepared
to be in a relationship.

00:04:24.934 --> 00:04:26.162
Prepared?

00:04:26.235 --> 00:04:29.295
Right now, I have too much going
on to devote my heart to love.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.508
Are you afraid of falling in love?

00:04:33.876 --> 00:04:35.639
To be honest, I am.

00:04:36.178 --> 00:04:38.146
We're very similar.
I'm also afraid.

00:04:38.447 --> 00:04:39.243
What?!

00:04:39.348 --> 00:04:43.876
Master, you make advances towards
every beautiful woman you see!

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.588
I'm only able to do it
because I consider it play.

00:04:47.523 --> 00:04:50.788
But if I should find that
special someone...

00:04:50.893 --> 00:04:52.622
...I'll no longer be able to hesitate.

00:04:55.364 --> 00:04:56.456
Korin.

00:04:57.066 --> 00:04:59.057
Will you play your erhu again?

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:02.237
Yes.

00:05:04.073 --> 00:05:07.372
Little Whirlwind,
back then I really liked...

00:05:07.944 --> 00:05:11.607
...how you could kill so coldly
with that pretty face.

00:05:12.181 --> 00:05:15.480
Do you have any idea how proud
I was to have you all to myself?

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.184
You haven't changed one bit,
have you, OI' Meisho?

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:26.057
Quit being such an idiot and get lost.
You're an eyesore. I might kill you.

00:05:26.862 --> 00:05:30.229
Oh, how low the young master of
a wealthy merchant family has fallen.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:32.361
You're like a common thug.

00:05:32.435 --> 00:05:34.903
Though I was only a kid,
I still haven't forgotten...

00:05:34.971 --> 00:05:37.667
...the face of the painter who came
to our home claiming to be popular.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.635
Your face!

00:05:57.493 --> 00:05:59.654
Our leader's one and only mistake...

00:05:59.729 --> 00:06:03.290
...was deciding on a whim
not to kill you when we broke in.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:07.931
And all because one child was spared,
the Murderous Blades were wiped out.

00:06:08.604 --> 00:06:11.573
My one and only mistake was,
after you escaped...

00:06:11.641 --> 00:06:14.838
...I didn't chase you
to the ends of Hell and kill you.

00:06:15.745 --> 00:06:17.713
Go ahead and state your business.

00:06:17.947 --> 00:06:20.381
I wouldn't mind finishing
things off now, you know.

00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:23.881
I just came to see
your faces today. Listen.

00:06:24.387 --> 00:06:27.447
Unlike our previous leader,
I use what I have up here.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:30.092
Come to Kinka and see.

00:06:30.092 --> 00:06:31.957
You'll understand the meaning
of my words then.

00:06:32.695 --> 00:06:34.822
Be sure to prepare a grave
and casket for yourself.

00:06:35.264 --> 00:06:37.994
Unlike a certain someone
I'm a nice guy...

00:06:38.167 --> 00:06:40.692
...but I'm not kind enough
to prepare those for you.

00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:44.501
I'll see that they're prepared.
However, they'll be for you.

00:06:45.141 --> 00:06:47.769
Because unlike someone,
I'm considerate.

00:06:52.748 --> 00:06:54.739
What a rotten guy to run into.

00:06:56.318 --> 00:06:59.719
Let's go. I'll treat you
to a cup of Gan Lu tea.

00:07:01.757 --> 00:07:04.055
I'll let you treat me to
anything but Gan Lu tea.

00:07:04.126 --> 00:07:06.094
Why's that? Well, yeah.

00:07:06.328 --> 00:07:09.126
Gan Lu tea is something you'd
rather have Princess make for you.

00:07:09.999 --> 00:07:12.490
I prefer to save the best for last.

00:07:12.935 --> 00:07:16.894
Yeah? Well, I don't leave things
for later. I go right after them.

00:07:17.406 --> 00:07:18.873
No doubt.

00:07:28.651 --> 00:07:29.777
Hey, Korin.

00:07:29.885 --> 00:07:30.613
Yes?

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:32.319
We'll arrive in Kinka soon.

00:07:32.388 --> 00:07:35.619
When we get there,
will you tell me your real name?

00:07:38.127 --> 00:07:41.893
The name Korin doesn't
suit you. It's too cute.

00:07:43.032 --> 00:07:45.626
Well I'm sorry for not being cute!

00:07:46.335 --> 00:07:48.997
A more dignified name
would suit you better.

00:08:02.885 --> 00:08:04.352
Master!

00:08:06.322 --> 00:08:07.448
Korin.

00:08:08.023 --> 00:08:09.923
Good night, Korin.

00:08:25.641 --> 00:08:28.109
When I get to Kinka,
I'll be able to see everyone.

00:08:28.277 --> 00:08:30.245
I just have to endure this a bit longer.

00:08:31.981 --> 00:08:33.915
We'll arrive in Kinka shortly.

00:08:33.983 --> 00:08:35.951
I asked you to help me
with my studies...

00:08:36.018 --> 00:08:38.282
...but I'm struggling as your student.
I'm so sorry.

00:08:38.921 --> 00:08:40.912
And to think I'm a lot older
than you are.

00:08:41.657 --> 00:08:44.148
Do you want to become
an official, Kokujun?

00:08:44.794 --> 00:08:50.096
I thought I'd pass the National
Exams and be like Great Uncle Enjun.

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:54.233
And I figured I could do
that by having the person...

00:08:54.603 --> 00:08:57.629
...who passed as Jogen at age
thirteen help me with my studies.

00:08:58.607 --> 00:09:01.075
I'm sorry for asking such
a strange favor of you.

00:09:01.443 --> 00:09:04.276
Well, um... By Enjun...

00:09:05.147 --> 00:09:07.581
...do you mean the recently
deceased Advisor Sa?

00:09:07.983 --> 00:09:10.747
Yes! Great Uncle was
an incredible person.

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:13.886
He was probably what people
refer to as a genius.

00:09:13.956 --> 00:09:17.414
Great Uncle was the pride of the
Sa Clan, and I've always admired him.

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:20.590
You've already studied
quite a lot, haven't you?

00:09:20.663 --> 00:09:23.029
You seem to have a good
understanding of all the fundamentals.

00:09:24.233 --> 00:09:28.693
Only in terms of number of years.
But I'm nothing compared to you.

00:09:29.538 --> 00:09:32.268
You have a point.
You're not a genius, after all.

00:09:32.575 --> 00:09:34.338
Eigetsu! How could you!

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:36.605
No, it's the truth.

00:09:37.379 --> 00:09:39.370
And I'm not a genius either.

00:09:39.515 --> 00:09:41.881
Ah, well, but if anyone is,
you are definitely a genius.

00:09:49.124 --> 00:09:51.115
I studied with all my heart.

00:09:52.094 --> 00:09:53.925
I had neither time nor money...

00:09:53.996 --> 00:09:55.623
...and the recent exam was to be
my first and final attempt...

00:09:55.698 --> 00:09:56.790
...at the National Exams.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:00.760
I really took my time and had trouble
absorbing what I was studying.

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:04.662
I'd memorize material by transcribing
it over and over until I was satisfied.

00:10:05.341 --> 00:10:08.333
I didn't want to waste money
on paper, so in the wintertime...

00:10:08.777 --> 00:10:10.745
...I'd write in the temple's fields
with a stick.

00:10:10.813 --> 00:10:12.781
During other seasons, I'd write
on the paths between rice fields.

00:10:12.848 --> 00:10:15.316
By doing that, I was eventually able
to write everything from memory.

00:10:15.618 --> 00:10:17.586
But I still lacked confidence.

00:10:18.287 --> 00:10:22.849
I had to put in that much work
in order to pass. So, am I a genius?

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:29.463
I'm sorry. I'm really pathetic, aren't I?
And I'm almost eighteen.

00:10:30.399 --> 00:10:33.732
Please do not apologize.
I'm not arguing.

00:10:34.336 --> 00:10:37.305
While I may sound impertinent,
I just wanted you to realize...

00:10:37.373 --> 00:10:40.342
...that you may not be a genius,
but there are ways to make up for it.

00:10:44.713 --> 00:10:46.681
Kill the two kids?

00:10:46.749 --> 00:10:49.411
Yes. It's an order from
the person who hired us.

00:10:50.052 --> 00:10:52.987
Weren't you gonna make the lady
of the Hong Clan Sakujun's wife?

00:10:53.522 --> 00:10:55.888
Apparently that girl is a fake.

00:10:56.025 --> 00:10:56.821
A fake?!

00:10:57.893 --> 00:11:00.828
You mean some ordinary girl
made an utter fool outta me?!

00:11:03.866 --> 00:11:06.926
I won't forgive them!
I'll kill those two brats myself.

00:11:07.436 --> 00:11:12.169
Do as you please. But it appears
that you're going to have to wait a bit.

00:11:12.675 --> 00:11:15.371
We'll put them to good use first
before killing them.

00:11:15.844 --> 00:11:16.640
Good use?

00:11:16.712 --> 00:11:18.646
Yeah, but never mind that.

00:11:18.714 --> 00:11:20.375
Something interesting has come
into our possession.

00:11:24.954 --> 00:11:27.149
Turn that flat rock over.

00:11:29.692 --> 00:11:31.660
This... it's the governor's seal!

00:11:31.794 --> 00:11:33.489
This one's a part of the charm.

00:11:34.196 --> 00:11:35.993
I'm having them search for
the other pieces.

00:11:36.498 --> 00:11:38.659
The seal was found inside
a steamed bun.

00:11:39.335 --> 00:11:42.498
The charm was stuck to a gold
chamber pot as decoration.

00:11:43.038 --> 00:11:44.471
A chamber pot?

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:48.533
I doubt they ever expected us to
break open every single steamed bun.

00:11:49.178 --> 00:11:50.543
As long as we have these...

00:11:50.913 --> 00:11:52.244
...we have no need for the governors.

00:11:52.748 --> 00:11:55.216
All we need to do now is
wait for their arrival.

00:11:55.584 --> 00:11:56.551
Right.

00:11:57.553 --> 00:12:00.420
But in that case, where'd the
real girl from the Hong Clan go?

00:12:00.656 --> 00:12:04.956
She'll come out on her own soon
enough, to get the charm and seal.

00:12:05.461 --> 00:12:07.691
Now, all that remains is to
prepare a room...

00:12:07.763 --> 00:12:09.663
...for her wedding night
with Sakujun.

00:12:10.632 --> 00:12:12.600
But where is Sakujun, anyway?

00:12:13.002 --> 00:12:15.527
He says he's too afraid to stay
with the Murderous Blades...

00:12:15.938 --> 00:12:18.406
...so we arranged for
a separate residence for him.

00:12:18.841 --> 00:12:22.277
Darn. He's such a coward, you'd
never guess he's my younger brother.

00:12:22.945 --> 00:12:25.209
Well, never mind.
You know, Meisho.

00:12:25.647 --> 00:12:28.241
Why not serve me
instead of Grandfather?

00:12:28.584 --> 00:12:30.950
Are you planning
to push Chusho aside?

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:32.880
Well, how about it?

00:12:32.955 --> 00:12:35.924
I'll consider it and the prospects
it holds for the future.

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:47.928
Go on, take a look.
This is the town of Kinka.

00:12:50.239 --> 00:12:52.332
So this is the town of Kinka.

00:12:53.075 --> 00:12:58.035
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:13:04.153 --> 00:13:05.780
What's the matter?

00:13:05.854 --> 00:13:08.584
Is this the center of commerce
in Sa Province?

00:13:09.324 --> 00:13:10.814
That's right.

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:13.557
Something's not right.

00:13:14.563 --> 00:13:16.531
Why does this place lack vigor?

00:13:18.167 --> 00:13:20.761
What do you wish to do?
We reached Kinka, as promised.

00:13:21.503 --> 00:13:23.698
Would you like to come to
where I'll be staying?

00:13:23.772 --> 00:13:26.502
No, I have a number of places
I need to go.

00:13:26.775 --> 00:13:28.936
When I'm finished with my business
I'll come to say my goodbyes.

00:13:29.445 --> 00:13:31.413
Where will you be staying?

00:13:31.747 --> 00:13:35.148
My family has a residence here,
so I won't be staying at an inn.

00:13:35.751 --> 00:13:37.810
Just ask anyone where
the Chrysanthemum Residence is...

00:13:37.886 --> 00:13:39.285
...and they'll direct you.

00:13:39.354 --> 00:13:40.252
Very well.

00:13:40.489 --> 00:13:41.513
Korin.

00:13:43.725 --> 00:13:45.488
What is it?

00:13:45.561 --> 00:13:49.224
Nothing. Just, I'd feel better
if you wouldn't be so cold.

00:13:49.798 --> 00:13:51.925
But Master! You won't apologize!

00:13:52.601 --> 00:13:55.627
I won't apologize, because I haven't
done anything wrong.

00:14:01.176 --> 00:14:04.612
I wonder why. Seeing this man
reminds me of Ryuki.

00:14:05.447 --> 00:14:09.315
An accidental resemblance?
No, they're not at all alike.

00:14:11.887 --> 00:14:14.355
You said the Chrysanthemum
Residence, right?

00:14:14.423 --> 00:14:16.687
I should be able to
come by within the day.

00:14:16.825 --> 00:14:17.917
I'll be waiting.

00:14:17.993 --> 00:14:18.857
Until then.

00:14:23.332 --> 00:14:25.300
I'll be waiting.

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:34.008
They've got some seriously ill-bred
thugs patrolling the streets.

00:14:34.476 --> 00:14:36.876
They're obviously
not protecting the town.

00:14:36.945 --> 00:14:38.970
They're clearly creating a
scary environment!

00:14:40.015 --> 00:14:42.483
On top of that,
they're out in such numbers.

00:14:43.018 --> 00:14:44.986
It feels like we're all being watched.

00:14:46.355 --> 00:14:48.585
Ah, thank goodness.
I've finally arrived.

00:14:49.992 --> 00:14:52.961
They're not the Kinka's Merchants
Guild for nothing. This place is huge.

00:14:54.496 --> 00:14:56.623
But it's very quiet.

00:14:58.133 --> 00:15:01.625
Something's not right.
I should gather information first.

00:15:04.139 --> 00:15:05.333
Ah, I'm sorry!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.535
Young lady, might you be
visiting from out of town?

00:15:11.813 --> 00:15:13.781
Is this your first time to Kinka?

00:15:14.149 --> 00:15:16.310
Are you looking for work
with the Merchants Guild?

00:15:16.385 --> 00:15:18.250
U-Um...!

00:15:20.889 --> 00:15:23.084
His attire consists of
some pretty unusual items.

00:15:23.158 --> 00:15:25.626
Items your average person
would have difficulty getting.

00:15:25.694 --> 00:15:28.128
Are you associated with
the Merchants Guild?

00:15:28.197 --> 00:15:33.931
My, my. You're very perceptive.
Likewise, you carry a special token.

00:15:34.603 --> 00:15:36.594
It bears the seven colored
luminous paint.

00:15:38.273 --> 00:15:40.241
How do you know that?

00:15:43.412 --> 00:15:45.346
The Murderous Blades
have taken control...

00:15:45.414 --> 00:15:48.508
...of the Merchants' capital of Kinka.

00:15:49.518 --> 00:15:52.681
Is he the Kinka Special District
leader of the Merchants Guild?

00:16:01.863 --> 00:16:03.956
By the way, the Guild Hall
we were just at...

00:16:04.032 --> 00:16:06.091
...has been a den of thieves
for some time.

00:16:06.768 --> 00:16:08.599
What do you mean?

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:09.728
A few months ago...

00:16:09.805 --> 00:16:13.400
...the Murderous Blades
suddenly came into town en masse.

00:16:14.209 --> 00:16:16.177
They were most ingenious.

00:16:16.578 --> 00:16:19.274
Even though they'd forced their way
into town, there was no looting.

00:16:20.349 --> 00:16:22.817
Meisho, the man who called
himself their leader...

00:16:22.985 --> 00:16:27.684
...declared that if the townspeople
accepted them, they would do no harm.

00:16:28.423 --> 00:16:31.256
And Kinka's mayor
accepted that condition?

00:16:32.094 --> 00:16:34.085
He chose to put
the people's lives first.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:37.490
Those people were not at all
reckless in their command.

00:16:38.333 --> 00:16:41.598
However, they made certain everyone
was clear who was in control...

00:16:42.404 --> 00:16:44.838
...and have slowly and increasingly
been putting psychological pressure...

00:16:44.906 --> 00:16:46.373
...on the people of Kinka.

00:16:46.975 --> 00:16:50.103
They've locked up the mayor,
their men patrol the town...

00:16:50.812 --> 00:16:53.542
...and by hinting that they have
the backing of the Sa Clan...!

00:16:53.715 --> 00:16:55.444
The Sa Clan?

00:16:55.517 --> 00:16:57.985
Merchants were drawn to the prospect
of being associated with the Sa Clan...

00:16:58.053 --> 00:17:00.521
...and one after another,
merchants began to support them.

00:17:00.789 --> 00:17:03.189
On the surface, so are we,
the Merchants Guild.

00:17:05.694 --> 00:17:07.662
That's right.
We're merchants.

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:10.794
We never stop calculating
and weighing profits and losses.

00:17:11.133 --> 00:17:14.227
And depending on the circumstances,
we'll become anyone's ally.

00:17:15.637 --> 00:17:18.538
This is the moment of reckoning.
It's my first job as governor.

00:17:19.341 --> 00:17:21.809
I have to get the Merchants Guild
on our side no matter what.

00:17:23.345 --> 00:17:25.813
If I can't do that,
then we have no chance...

00:17:25.881 --> 00:17:28.349
...when facing the
Murderous Blades or the Sa Clan.

00:17:28.417 --> 00:17:30.385
Please state your conditions.

00:17:30.485 --> 00:17:34.080
What must I do to get you to mobilize
the Merchants Guild's mercenaries?

00:17:37.192 --> 00:17:39.524
Then please show us
the cards in your hand.

00:17:39.828 --> 00:17:43.286
After taking into consideration
your cards and our conditions...

00:17:43.565 --> 00:17:46.033
...if we determine that you have
an eighty percent chance of success...

00:17:46.301 --> 00:17:48.269
...we will support you.

00:17:49.304 --> 00:17:51.135
According to our sources...

00:17:51.206 --> 00:17:55.870
...the Murderous Blades have already
obtained the governor's seal and charm.

00:17:56.812 --> 00:18:00.145
So those two things
will be of no use in this trade.

00:18:00.782 --> 00:18:03.512
That is absolutely not possible.
They're fakes.

00:18:06.254 --> 00:18:08.222
What makes you say they're fakes?

00:18:08.457 --> 00:18:09.924
The fact is...!

00:18:09.991 --> 00:18:11.925
The governor's seal and charm
should get to Kinka...

00:18:11.993 --> 00:18:13.688
...about the same time you do.

00:18:14.663 --> 00:18:17.689
Even without any more information,
you'll know the instant you see them.

00:18:18.033 --> 00:18:22.231
I will leave them somewhere very safe
where no one will be able to steal them.

00:18:23.338 --> 00:18:27.240
That's what His Majesty the King said.
I think we can believe his words.

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:31.037
So, where exactly are they?

00:18:31.279 --> 00:18:33.873
Well... I don't know yet.

00:18:35.584 --> 00:18:37.552
I will find them, without fail.

00:18:40.055 --> 00:18:43.991
We would never use such a foolish
and irresponsible system.

00:18:46.194 --> 00:18:48.321
However, how do you intend
to find them?

00:19:00.142 --> 00:19:01.632
So this is Kinka?

00:19:02.043 --> 00:19:03.738
Sh-Show us your pass.

00:19:04.446 --> 00:19:07.813
Ah, that's right.
Now, where did I put it?

00:19:14.589 --> 00:19:16.853
Hey! You're holding up the line! Hurry!

00:19:18.026 --> 00:19:21.860
I've never been told to hurry up
before in my entire life.

00:19:24.232 --> 00:19:26.826
It could be fun
to hurry in life for once!

00:19:36.511 --> 00:19:38.103
Ah, there it is.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:41.510
Come on!
Causing so much trouble.

00:19:42.984 --> 00:19:46.750
The Twin Dragons?!
Y-You're a member of the Ran Clan?!

00:19:56.798 --> 00:19:59.494
Now then. Why don't I play you a melody
to celebrate my arrival in Kinka?

00:20:03.605 --> 00:20:05.266
Th-That flute!

00:20:05.340 --> 00:20:09.606
Th-This person is that
Ryuren Ran guy.

00:20:10.612 --> 00:20:12.580
Big brother!

00:20:17.152 --> 00:20:20.383
I will find the governor's
seal and charm within the day.

00:20:21.223 --> 00:20:24.784
Also, the assistant to the governors,
Lieutenant Governor Ensei Ro...

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:27.728
...is traveling with the officer
serving the governors, Seiran Si...

00:20:27.896 --> 00:20:30.660
...who was presented with a treasured
sword by His Majesty himself...

00:20:31.166 --> 00:20:33.726
...and has a rank greater
than Sa Province's general.

00:20:34.636 --> 00:20:40.541
They, along with the other governor,
Eigetsu To, will arrive in Kinka shortly.

00:20:41.576 --> 00:20:45.512
I see. And those are all your cards?

00:20:45.947 --> 00:20:47.244
No.

00:20:47.716 --> 00:20:50.879
I cannot lose no matter what.
If I lose here, we don't stand a chance.

00:20:51.553 --> 00:20:53.919
I will do whatever I must
to win this fight!

00:20:55.423 --> 00:20:58.085
My final card... is my own life!

00:21:01.029 --> 00:21:04.089
If it should come to that,
I will make a deal with my life.

00:21:04.666 --> 00:21:05.792
Meaning?

00:21:05.867 --> 00:21:07.835
Loss of my life here in Sa Province...

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:12.730
...would have a massive impact
on the Hong family name that I carry.

00:21:13.742 --> 00:21:16.210
The Sa Clan cannot kill a lady of the
direct line of the Hong Clan.

00:21:16.578 --> 00:21:18.443
The resulting backlash
would be too great.

00:21:18.513 --> 00:21:24.042
And that's why my life
has value in this bargain.

00:21:28.557 --> 00:21:30.684
There is no certainty in that last card.

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:35.926
We won't know how the Hong Clan
will react until that time comes.

00:21:36.665 --> 00:21:38.064
However...!

00:21:39.901 --> 00:21:41.926
We will give you our conditions.

00:21:42.704 --> 00:21:46.162
Get rid of the leader of the Murderous
Blades as well as his senior officers.

00:21:46.841 --> 00:21:48.832
If you tell us that you can do that...

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:51.845
...then I shall promise to send
our elite troops to join you.

00:21:52.614 --> 00:21:54.673
I see value in that strong
spirit of yours.

00:21:56.284 --> 00:21:58.252
Thank you very much!

00:21:58.453 --> 00:22:00.011
Governor Hong.

00:22:00.088 --> 00:22:00.645
Yes!

00:22:01.056 --> 00:22:04.514
Will you promise not to betray the
hopes of the people of Sa Province?

00:22:07.095 --> 00:22:08.960
Yes.

00:22:14.769 --> 00:22:17.033
We've finally reached Kinka.

00:22:17.105 --> 00:22:17.503
Yes.

00:22:22.310 --> 00:22:23.368
Mister Kokujun?

00:22:26.348 --> 00:22:28.179
I've been waiting for you!

00:22:30.986 --> 00:22:36.549
Welcome to Kinka, Governor To
and the young lady imposter.

00:22:47.068 --> 00:22:49.559
Shall we get a room for you
for the night?

00:22:49.838 --> 00:22:51.271
Ah, there's no need for that.

00:22:51.339 --> 00:22:54.672
I'll be staying at the residence
of the son of the Rin Clan.

00:22:57.879 --> 00:22:59.847
Um, is something wrong?

00:23:00.782 --> 00:23:04.548
A few days ago, the entire Rin Clan was
slaughtered by the Murderous Blades.

00:23:04.986 --> 00:23:07.147
There were no survivors.

00:23:09.324 --> 00:23:11.292
How could that be?

00:23:16.097 --> 00:23:18.361
Then, who is that man?

00:23:22.404 --> 00:23:25.737
Who in the world... is he?

00:23:30.578 --> 00:23:35.675
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.817 --> 00:23:42.381
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.490 --> 00:23:47.553
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.662 --> 00:23:52.656
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.735 --> 00:23:58.195
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.741 --> 00:24:04.872
You are just like me

00:24:05.613 --> 00:24:10.141
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.218 --> 00:24:16.123
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.092 --> 00:24:22.894
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:22.997 --> 00:24:27.866
I will always think of you

00:24:29.003 --> 00:24:41.677
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.120 --> 00:24:45.820
Next Episode

00:24:45.820 --> 00:24:48.189
Next Episode
I finally reached Kinka...

00:24:48.189 --> 00:24:48.223
Next Episode

00:24:48.223 --> 00:24:51.226
Next Episode
Crows in a Moonless Night
...where I promised to meet up with
Seiran, Ensei, Korin, and Eigetsu.

00:24:51.226 --> 00:24:51.359
Next Episode
